{"id": "EUVD-2026-75572", "enisaUuid": "0b671a8a-c865-3e13-845b-09bb1ac6dc26", "description": "Anchor CMS through 0.12.7 fails to enforce role-based access control in admin user-management endpoints, allowing any authenticated low-privilege user to create administrator accounts or modify existing ones. Attackers with editor or user roles can POST directly to admin/users/add or admin/users/edit endpoints to create new administrator accounts or change the existing administrator's password, gaining full administrative access.", "datePublished": "2026-09-10T15:44:12", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:21:33", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://gist.github.com/bozorovab2009-spec/57931237f774b78333f8fe47e84ec4aa", "https://github.com/anchorcms/anchor-cms/blob/0.12.7/anchor/routes/users.php", "https://github.com/anchorcms/anchor-cms", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/anchor-cms-through-0.12.7-privilege-escalation-via-missing-authorization-on-admin-user-management-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-88959", "GHSA-gpm9-mh97-xhwr"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.52, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "a2944334-e311-34a1-abc2-99076e84a4c2", "product": {"name": "Anchor CMS", "vendor": {"name": "anchorcms"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.12.7"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "969cff54-5952-373e-abce-0fbacd82724d", "vendor": {"name": "anchorcms"}}], "isExploited": false}